    {
      "name": "Reto 4b - Backend caído (manual)",
      "description": "Ejecutar por separado. 1) docker compose stop ms-pagos  2) Send  3) docker compose start ms-pagos. No incluir en la corrida completa del Runner.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Backend caído -> 502/503/504",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-api-key",
                "value": "{{apiKeyQA}}",
                "type": "text"
